id: DRAFT-E5xx-ohos-libcpp-missing-ranges-algorithms
title: OHOS SDK libc++ 缺少 C++20 ranges 算法重载导致 std::ranges::none_of 等编译失败
category: ohos, toolchain, libc++, c++20, portability
severity: 2
error_signature: "no member named 'none_of' in namespace 'std::ranges'; did you mean 'std::none_of'?"
match_keywords: std::ranges, none_of, libc++, clang 15, C++20, ranges algorithm, invalid argument type 'void' to unary expression
error_excerpt: >
  error: no member named 'none_of' in namespace 'std::__n1::ranges'; did you
  mean 'std::none_of'?
root_cause: >
  OHOS SDK 的 libc++（clang 15 配套）是裁剪版：<algorithm> 头文件的
  __algorithm/none_of.h 只含 C++17 迭代器对版本 none_of(first, last, pred)，
  未提供 C++20 ranges 版 none_of(range, pred)。上游源码（KDE Frameworks
  6.28+ 使用 std::ranges::none_of）在 -std=c++20 下编译时直接报
  "no member named 'none_of' in namespace 'std::ranges'"。
rec_approach: >
  可移植性补丁：将 std::ranges::none_of(range, pred) 替换为语义等价的
  std::none_of(range.cbegin(), range.cend(), pred)。同理适用于其他 ranges
  算法（find_if/all_of/any_of/count_if 等）——若上游用了 ranges 版本而
  OHOS libc++ 缺失，均可用迭代器对版本替换。
solution: |
  # 0001-holidayregion-use-std-none_of-for-OHOS-libc.patch（kholidays 6.28.0 实证）
  -        list.erase(std::remove_if(list.begin(),
  -                                  list.end(),
  -                                  [this](const auto &h) {
  -                                      return std::ranges::none_of(mCategories, [h](const QString &category) {
  -                                          return h.categoryList().contains(category);
  -                                      });
  -                                  }),
  +        list.erase(std::remove_if(list.begin(),
  +                                  list.end(),
  +                                  [this](const auto &h) {
  +                                      return std::none_of(mCategories.cbegin(), mCategories.cend(), [h](const QString &category) {
  +                                          return h.categoryList().contains(category);
  +                                      });
  +                                  }),
                    list.end());
fallback: >
  若替换面大（源码大量使用 ranges），可引入 range-v3 或实现本地
  none_of 兼容层；但单点使用场景补丁替换成本最低。
verify_builds: "kholidays 6.28.0 PR #11108 CI 构建 #51068（passed）"
prescan_pattern: "std::ranges::(none_of|all_of|any_of|find_if|count_if)"
kb_ref: ""
last_updated: 2026-09-19
